      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "By the quotient rule, \\( h'(x) = \\frac{f'(x)\\,g(x) - f(x)\\,g'(x)}{\\left(g(x)\\right)^{2}} \\).",
         "rule_named": "quotient rule"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "So \\( h'(3) = \\frac{2 \\cdot \\left(-5\\right) - \\left(-1\\right) \\cdot \\left(-2\\right)}{\\left(-5\\right)^{2}} = - \\frac{12}{25} \\).",
